{"parentUuid":"a070e5e4-f724-4ccb-817f-e74c15cf50f4","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"a7322ed66982214c7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RUXULxsX6SaRjXUgWchDX1","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"ALNS adaptive large neighborhood search Python library github\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"GitHub - N-Wouda/ALNS: Adaptive large neighbourhood search (and more!) in Python. · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/N-Wouda/ALNS\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - alberto-santini/adaptive-large-neighbourhood-search: ALNS header-only library (loosely) based on the original implementation by Stefan Ropke. · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/alberto-santini/adaptive-large-neighbourhood-search\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - RobbertReijnen/DR-ALNS: [ICAPS 2024] DR-ALNS: Deep Reinforced Adaptive Large Neighborhood Search · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/RobbertReijnen/DR-ALNS\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - WeberZheng/ALNS: Adaptive Large Neighborhood Search Algorithm for paper \\\"Robust Dual Sourcing Inventory Routing Optimization for Disaster Relief\\\"\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/WeberZheng/ALNS\"},{\"title\":\"ALNS/README.md at master · N-Wouda/ALNS\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/N-Wouda/ALNS/blob/master/README.md\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - souleymanebalde/ALNS_vrptw: Adaptive large neighbourhood search (and more!) in Python.\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/souleymanebalde/ALNS_vrptw\"},{\"title\":\"ALNS: a Python implementation of the adaptive large ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.theoj.org/joss-papers/joss.05028/10.21105.joss.05028.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"adaptive-large-neighbourhood-search · GitHub Topics · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/topics/adaptive-large-neighbourhood-search\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - QiuziChen/alns-framework-for-evsp: An ALNS framwork for solving EVSP written in Python.\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/QiuziChen/alns-framework-for-evsp\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - LingLi28/PDPTW: Adaptive Large Neighborhood Search heuristic (ALNS) algorithm for PDPTW.\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/LingLi28/PDPTW\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's information about the ALNS adaptive large neighborhood search Python library on GitHub:\n\n## Main Python Library\n\nThe primary Python ALNS library is **N-Wouda/ALNS**: alns is a general, well-documented and tested implementation of the adaptive large neighbourhood search (ALNS) metaheuristic in Python. \n\n**GitHub Repository:** https://github.com/N-Wouda/ALNS\n\n### Key Features:\n\n- ALNS is an algorithm that can be used to solve difficult combinatorial optimisation problems\n- The alns package depends on numpy and matplotlib and may be installed in the usual way\n- The library was published in the Journal of Open Source Software by Wouda, N.A., and L. Lan (2023) as \"ALNS: a Python implementation of the adaptive large neighbourhood search metaheuristic\"\n\n### Example Applications:\n\nThe library includes documentation with examples for solving:\n- The travelling salesman problem (TSP), with an instance of 131 cities using simple destroy and repair heuristics\n- The capacitated vehicle routing problem (CVRP), with an instance of 241 customers\n- The cutting-stock problem (CSP)\n\nThe library is actively maintained and welcomes contributions on GitHub.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"c2843731-81a1-4cb6-9310-46b3e23133a3","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:09:49.879Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a070e5e4-f724-4ccb-817f-e74c15cf50f4","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
